			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730280101,
					"content": "看來這裡也有大機器人的零件，要是讓加扎里先生看到的話，大概又要掏出他的那台留影機了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280102,
					"content": "說起來，之前蘭利遮說，秘密基地裡的大零件是蘭利遮搬過去的，該不會是真的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280103,
					"content": "當然是真的，蘭利遮不騙那菈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280104,
						730280105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭利遮"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280104,
					"content": "果然…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730280106,
					"content": "蘭利遮就是當初陪著孩子們在秘密基地裡玩耍的蘭那羅吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280107,
					"content": "不過蘭利遮也什麼都不記得了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280108,
						730280109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280108,
					"content": "或許和筆記裡的花有關吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730280110,
					"content": "嗯，之前無郁稠林的蘭那羅把花花給我們之後，也忘記了所有的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280111,
					"content": "或許他們三個也經歷過和我們一樣的冒險吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280112,
					"content": "#蘭利遮不知道{F#妳}{M#你}們說的是什麼，也想不起來。不過，和小那菈玩，很開心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭利遮"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280113,
					"content": "嗯，要一直開心喔，蘭利遮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280109,
					"content": "我們之前也遇到過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280110
					]
				},
				{
